  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Quality Health Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FHI 360-led QHI consortium will amplify the potential impact of evidence-based MNCH interventions through a package of technical support that builds the capacity of those who manage existing systems and structures to efficiently deliver MNCH services. FHI 360 aims to position Nampula Province as a model HS that achieves clinical standards for quality, empowers its HWs and engages patients in the QI design.</narrative>
  </description>
